      fr: "\xC9p\xE9e en mithril activant [Frappe Miracle]"
      de: "Mithrilschwert mit [Wunderschnitt]-F\xE4higkeit"
      ru: "\u041C\u0438\u0444\u0440\u0438\u043B\u043E\u0432\u044B\u0439 \u043C\u0435\u0447
        \u0441 \u0443\u043C\u0435\u043D\u0438\u0435\u043C [\u0427\u0443\u0434\u043E-\u0443\u0434\u0430\u0440]"
      es: 'Espada de Mithril que activa [Tajo Milagroso]'
      pt: 'Espada de Mithril que Ativa [Golpe Milagroso]'
      it: 'Spada di Mithril che attiva [Taglio Miracoloso]'
      tr: "[Mucize Kesme] Yetene\u011Fini Aktive Eden Mithril K\u0131l\u0131\xE7"
