      ms: 'Binatang biasa, hasilkan [Kristal api]'
      id: 'Hewan biasa, menghasilkan [Kristal api]'
    - cn: "\u666E\u901A\u7684\u517D\u7C7B\uFF0C\u53EF\u4EE5\u4EA7\u51FA[\u517D\u76AE]"
